3. Viewer library
   niivue - https://github.com/niivue/niivue - BSD-2-Clause

Region names come from the FSL atlas XML files (HarvardOxford-Cortical-Lateralized.xml,
HarvardOxford-Subcortical.xml). Region coordinates are centroids computed offline from
the atlas label volumes and are expressed in MNI152 millimetres.
